    "steam_appid": 2659960,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659960/extras/b2b9dc76681d8c6ee5627adb6b969f08.avif?t=1752718803\" width=616 height=64 /></span><br>You are a young man living in the city. Every day, you were busy with work, leading a hectic life.<br>Tired of such a lifestyle, you began to yearn for a slow life in a place rich in nature. At that time, you heard that a ranch in a certain rural village was being sold cheaply, so you decided to buy the ranch to start a second life.<br>However, the village chief you met seems to have a favor to ask of you...?<br><br>&quot;Could you possibly have children with the young women in the village?&quot;<br><br>This game is a farm life simulation game.<br>Players will control this young man, growing vegetables, raising livestock, and after work, go out to the village to get along with the women.<br>As you get closer, events that deepen the relationship occur, and eventually, they may wish to have your children.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659960/extras/2c54ad5dbad050d22bb116aa2671f5be.avif?t=1752718803\" width=616 height=64 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Slow Life<br></li><li>Farm Life Simulation<br></li><li>16 Romanceable Characters</li></ul>",
